# GoldHEN Plugins Configuration
# Copy this to /data/GoldHEN/plugins.ini on your PS4
#
# Starting with v1.4.0, this plugin can be safely loaded under [default].
# The plugin automatically skips non-game processes (Homebrew, system daemons)
# so homebrew apps will not crash.

[default]
/data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_controller.prx

# Or, if you prefer to enable it only for specific game Title IDs:
# [CUSA00123]
# /data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_controller.prx
